{"id":"0e224bb32227a0f8","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Meagre Set","display":"df-zfc-top5-meagre-set — ZFC Top5 Meagre Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-meagre-set — ZFC Top5 Meagre Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-meagre-set — ZFC Top5 Meagre Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9198a4b832ce065f\" href=\"?note=9198a4b832ce065f\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9198a4b832ce065f\" href=\"?note=9198a4b832ce065f\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}meagre\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\vec A\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(\\vec A,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,\\vec A(n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}meagre\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\vec A\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(\\vec A,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,\\vec A(n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A meagre set is covered by the range of a genuine <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-sequence of nowhere dense subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9198a4b832ce065f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9198a4b832ce065f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}meagre\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\vec A\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(\\vec A,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(n)\\\\\n&\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,\\vec A(n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1466,"backlinks":[{"id":"bed07eb8eab20313","anchor":"ref-3","locati